{"name":"Starfox","hex":"#f0e8d5","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Star Fox (1993 video game)","blocks":[{"text":"Star Fox, known as Starwing in PAL regions, is a 1993 rail shooter game developed by Nintendo EAD and Argonaut Software, and published by Nintendo for the Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES). The first entry in the Star Fox series, the story follows pilot Fox McCloud and his elite squadron of mercenaries known as the Star Fox team defending their homeworld of Corneria against the invading forces of the malevolent mad scientist Andross."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/52/Star_Fox_SNES.jpg/330px-Star_Fox_SNES.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Star_Fox_(1993_video_game)","wikidata":"Q1326889"},{"title":"Star Fox (2026 video game)","blocks":[{"text":"Star Fox is a 2026 rail shooter game developed by Velan Studios and published by Nintendo for the Nintendo Switch 2. A remake of Star Fox 64 (1997), it adapts the original game's level design, story, and gameplay while introducing a new artstyle and rebooting the series."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/03/StarFox2026Cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Star_Fox_(2026_video_game)","wikidata":"Q139683849"},{"title":"Starfox (character)","blocks":[{"text":"Eros is a character appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. Created by writer and artist Jim Starlin, the character first appeared in The Invincible Iron Man #55. Eros is depicted as a member of the Eternals, a human offshoot race. Born on Titan, he is the son of A'lars / Mentor. He faces opposition from his mad brother, the supervillain Thanos."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/f5/Marvel%27s_Eros_as_Starfox_%282022_Design%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Starfox_(character)","wikidata":"Q2295563"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/27/SNES_Star_Fox_%28Starwing%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/27/SNES_Star_Fox_%28Starwing%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"The game is portrayed from both a third-person and first-person 3D perspective. Gameplay is centred around aerial combat. From left to right clockwise, the game's heads-up display shows the player's number of lives, ammunition, boost meter, and shield strength. This scenario shows the player in a boss fight.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASNES_Star_Fox_(Starwing).png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Torii_path_with_lantern_at_Fushimi_Inari_Taisha_Shrine%2C_Kyoto%2C_Japan.jpg/500px-Torii_path_with_lantern_at_Fushimi_Inari_Taisha_Shrine%2C_Kyoto%2C_Japan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Torii_path_with_lantern_at_Fushimi_Inari_Taisha_Shrine%2C_Kyoto%2C_Japan.jpg/1280px-Torii_path_with_lantern_at_Fushimi_Inari_Taisha_Shrine%2C_Kyoto%2C_Japan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Torii_path_with_lantern_at_Fushimi_Inari_Taisha_Shrine%2C_Kyoto%2C_Japan.jpg/500px-Torii_path_with_lantern_at_Fushimi_Inari_Taisha_Shrine%2C_Kyoto%2C_Japan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATorii_path_with_lantern_at_Fushimi_Inari_Taisha_Shrine%2C_Kyoto%2C_Japan.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Inari-kitsune_fox_in_front_of_an_Inari_shrine_with_a_key_in_its_mouth.jpg/330px-Inari-kitsune_fox_in_front_of_an_Inari_shrine_with_a_key_in_its_mouth.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Inari-kitsune_fox_in_front_of_an_Inari_shrine_with_a_key_in_its_mouth.jpg/330px-Inari-kitsune_fox_in_front_of_an_Inari_shrine_with_a_key_in_its_mouth.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AInari-kitsune_fox_in_front_of_an_Inari_shrine_with_a_key_in_its_mouth.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/3/34/Arwing%2C_Corneria%2C_2026_Starfox_Game.webp/330px-Arwing%2C_Corneria%2C_2026_Starfox_Game.webp?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/3/34/Arwing%2C_Corneria%2C_2026_Starfox_Game.webp/330px-Arwing%2C_Corneria%2C_2026_Starfox_Game.webp?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Screenshot of the player performing a barrel roll in the first level, Corneria","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AArwing%2C_Corneria%2C_2026_Starfox_Game.webp"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/9/93/Fox_McCloud_Design_Comparison.jpg/330px-Fox_McCloud_Design_Comparison.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/9/93/Fox_McCloud_Design_Comparison.jpg/330px-Fox_McCloud_Design_Comparison.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Fox McCloud's design in The Super Mario Galaxy Movie (left) and Star Fox (right)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFox_McCloud_Design_Comparison.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}